{'symbol': 'HII', 'date': '2022-06-16 18:15:00', 'title': 'HII AWARDED $240 MILLION ADVANCE PROCUREMENT CONTRACT FOR LPD 32', 'text': 'PASCAGOULA, MISS., JUNE 16, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- HII (NYSE:HII) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS INGALLS SHIPBUILDING DIVISION HAS RECEIVED A $240 MILLION, COST-PLUS-FIXED-FEE ADVANCE PROCUREMENT CONTRACT FROM THE U.S. NAVY TO PROVIDE LONG-LEAD-TIME MATERIAL AND ADVANCE CONSTRUCTION ACTIVITIES FOR AMPHIBIOUS TRANSPORT DOCK LPD 32. THE SHIP WILL BE THE 16TH IN THE SAN ANTONIO-CLASS CONSTRUCTED AT INGALLS SHIPBUILDING.'}